    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00001",
      "text": "Hong Kong has held candlelight vigils to commemorate the 1989 Tiananmen Square Massacre for over 30 years, but this tradition — like so many cherished by HongKongers — is facing extinction as Beijing tightens the screws.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 220,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1989_Tiananmen_Square_protests"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00002",
      "text": "On June 1, for the first time in history, Hong Kong police sent a letter of objection regarding the annual candlelight vigil to the event's organizer, the Hong Kong Alliance in Support of Patriotic Democratic Movements of China (HK Alliance).",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 222,
      "body_end": 464,
      "source_links": [
        "https://news.rthk.hk/rthk/en/component/k2/1529551-20200601.htm"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00003",
      "text": "In the letter, police called the vigil a “major threat to public health”.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 466,
      "body_end": 539,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00004",
      "text": "COVID-19 has been under control for weeks on the island and a number of physical distancing measures have been lifted — bars and beauty salons have been reopened, while elementary school students went back to school in May.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 541,
      "body_end": 764,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00005",
      "text": "The ban on the vigil this year is even more notable against the backdrop of China's decision to enact a tailor-made national security law in Hong Kong.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 766,
      "body_end": 917,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.scmp.com/news/hong-kong/politics/article/3086489/two-sessions-2020-national-security-law-hong-kong-step"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00006",
      "text": "Hong Kong's Former Chief Executive Leung Chung-ying last month hinted that the Victoria Park candlelight vigil may be banned under the terms of the future law.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 919,
      "body_end": 1078,
      "source_links": [
        "https://news.rthk.hk/rthk/en/component/k2/1528043-20200524.htm"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00007",
      "text": "Since 1990, the vigil organized by the HK Alliance has seen protesters chant slogans including “release the dissidents”, “rehabilitate the 1989 pro-democracy movement”, “demand accountability for the June 4 massacre”, “end one-party dictatorship” and “build a democratic China.”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "body_start": 1080,
      "body_end": 1358,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00008",
      "text": "These demands could be considered as “inciting sedition” under national security legislation that is already in force in mainland China.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "body_start": 1360,
      "body_end": 1496,
      "source_links": [
        "https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSch2DwwlQut6ckmpPFdyAVMfevVOIalCN68P6oOFks_C_rqWg/viewform"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00009",
      "text": "The HK Alliance said that its members will still gather at Victoria Park to light candles on June 4 and urged Hong Kong citizens to do the same all across the city. The event will be livestreamed.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "body_start": 1498,
      "body_end": 1694,
      "source_links": [
        "https://hka8964.wordpress.com/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00010",
      "text": "Twitter user Yuen Chan translated HK Alliance’s statement into English:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "body_start": 1696,
      "body_end": 1767,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00011",
      "text": "Marking ‘the 35th of May’",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "body_start": 1769,
      "body_end": 1794,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "h3",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00012",
      "text": "The vigil is just one of a number of initiatives to commemorate June 4 in Hong Kong.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "body_start": 1796,
      "body_end": 1880,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00013",
      "text": "This year, some District Councils with pro-democracy incumbents have passed motions to urge the Chinese government to “rehabilitate June 4 as a patriotic pro-democracy movement.”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 13,
      "body_start": 1882,
      "body_end": 2060,
      "source_links": [
        "http://www.inmediahk.net/node/1073682"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00014",
      "text": "A theatrical group, June 4 Theatre, is set to broadcast its drama “The 35th of May” on June 4 for 24 hours straight in order to commemorate the Tiananmen violence.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 14,
      "body_start": 2062,
      "body_end": 2225,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00015",
      "text": "The title of the drama is an attempt to circumvent pervasive censorship in China that sees “64”, “六四” and “六月四日” (June 4) heavily censored during the months of May and June.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 15,
      "body_start": 2227,
      "body_end": 2400,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00016",
      "text": "The theatrical group stressed that remembering June 4 is a “battle against amnesia” in Hong Kong.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "body_start": 2402,
      "body_end": 2499,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.thestandnews.com/art/%E5%85%AD%E5%9B%9B%E8%88%9E%E5%8F%B0-5%E6%9C%8835%E6%97%A5-%E5%85%A8%E6%96%B0%E7%8F%AD%E5%BA%95-%E7%9C%BE%E7%B1%8C%E6%BC%94%E5%87%BA%E4%BD%9C%E7%B6%B2%E4%B8%8A%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E7%9B%B4%E6%92%AD/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00017",
      "text": "Yellow Avenger, a Facebook page promoting local businesses that are pro-democracy, urged Hongkongers to donate to the June 4 Theatre:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 17,
      "body_start": 2501,
      "body_end": 2634,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/yellowavengers2/posts/237318704384831"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00018",
      "text": "> “香港人講六四是「記憶與遺忘的戰爭」。”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "body_start": 2636,
      "body_end": 2658,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00019",
      "text": "> 其實呢一年來香港人又何嘗唔係,",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "body_start": 2660,
      "body_end": 2677,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00020",
      "text": "> 教科書改寫歷史,",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 20,
      "body_start": 2679,
      "body_end": 2689,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00021",
      "text": "> 監警會調查報告話無警黑合作。",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "body_start": 2691,
      "body_end": 2707,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00022",
      "text": "> 今日香港人如果唔將真正既香港歷史好好記錄低,他日下一代只會知道被篡改的所謂”歷史”。",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 22,
      "body_start": 2709,
      "body_end": 2753,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00023",
      "text": "> 香港人善忘, 但有些事情,",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 23,
      "body_start": 2755,
      "body_end": 2770,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00024",
      "text": "> 不想回憶, 未敢忘記。",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 24,
      "body_start": 2772,
      "body_end": 2785,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00025",
      "text": "> 你, 我, 他, 每一個人都有責任記錄低真正歷史,",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 25,
      "body_start": 2787,
      "body_end": 2814,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00026",
      "text": "> 請多支持各走在同一條抗爭路上的有心人?",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 26,
      "body_start": 2816,
      "body_end": 2837,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00027",
      "text": "> “Remembering June 4 is a battle against amnesia in Hong Kong.”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 27,
      "body_start": 2839,
      "body_end": 2903,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00028",
      "text": "> What we have seen in the past year is a similar battle.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 28,
      "body_start": 2905,
      "body_end": 2962,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00029",
      "text": "> Text books were edited to change history.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 29,
      "body_start": 2964,
      "body_end": 3007,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00030",
      "text": "> The report published by the Independent Police Complaints Council denied cooperation between the police and the triad [armed gangs, some of whom have ties to the mainland]",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 30,
      "body_start": 3009,
      "body_end": 3182,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/2019/10/30/the-hong-kong-protests-are-becoming-more-violent-because-justice-is-not-being-served/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00031",
      "text": "> If Hongkongers do not record our history today, the next generation will only learn the “edited” history.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 31,
      "body_start": 3184,
      "body_end": 3291,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00032",
      "text": "> Hongkongers are usually forgetful.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 32,
      "body_start": 3293,
      "body_end": 3329,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00033",
      "text": "> Certain issues we don’t want to remember, but refuse to forget.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 33,
      "body_start": 3331,
      "body_end": 3396,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00034",
      "text": "> Every single individual has the responsibility to record the truth in history.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 34,
      "body_start": 3398,
      "body_end": 3478,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00035",
      "text": "> Please support those who are walking along the same path.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 35,
      "body_start": 3480,
      "body_end": 3539,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00036",
      "text": "Visual artist Chan Ka Hing meanwhile promoted on Facebook his public performance called “We all are Tank Man” that will take place on June 5:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 36,
      "body_start": 3541,
      "body_end": 3682,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10222948666210360&set=a.10203759662457259&type=3&theater"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00037",
      "text": "> 一九八九年六月四日後，翌日（六月五日）於北京長安街上，發生了近代歷史上著名的「坦克人」事件。",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 37,
      "body_start": 3684,
      "body_end": 3732,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00038",
      "text": "> 今年六月五日，下午三時，我將身穿黑褲白恤衫，雙手持袋，默站於政總前，此為一個人之「藝術行為」，懇請大家切勿「模倣」。",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 38,
      "body_start": 3734,
      "body_end": 3794,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00039",
      "text": "> 此「藝術行為」會由政總開始，流動於港九各地，同樣會默站於某些「地點」，同樣，懇請大家切勿「模倣」。",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 39,
      "body_start": 3796,
      "body_end": 3847,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00040",
      "text": "> 「坦克人」場景三十一年不滅，他象徵不屈勇氣，一個震撼人心的場景，能牽動全世界相信普世價值的人，但願我能重現這一場景的意義。",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 40,
      "body_start": 3849,
      "body_end": 3912,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00041",
      "text": "> On June 5, the day after June 4, 1989, “Tank Man” appeared on Changon Street in Beijing.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 41,
      "body_start": 3914,
      "body_end": 4004,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tank_Man"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00042",
      "text": "> This year, on June 5 at 3 PM, I will stand still in front of the government headquarters, wearing a white T-shirt and a pair of black pants carrying plastic bags in my hands. This is an individual art performance, please do not “copy”.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 42,
      "body_start": 4006,
      "body_end": 4243,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00043",
      "text": "> The art performance will begin at the government headquarters and…I will then stand still in the same manner in other spots. Again, please do not “copy”.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 43,
      "body_start": 4245,
      "body_end": 4400,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00044",
      "text": "> The image of “Tank Man” has survived for 31 years. He is a symbol of unyielding courage. It shocked the world and connected people who believe in universal values. I hope my performance will remind people of its significance.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 44,
      "body_start": 4402,
      "body_end": 4629,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00045",
      "text": "Chan's plea for others not to copy him is best understood as a self-protection measure, since public calls for collective action online can be prosecuted under local public order legislation.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 45,
      "body_start": 4631,
      "body_end": 4822,
      "source_links": [
        "https://hongkongfp.com/2018/02/13/hong-kong-umbrella-movement-trial-court-refuses-scrap-inciting-others-incite-public-nuisance-charge/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00046",
      "text": "Tiananmen taboo",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 46,
      "body_start": 4824,
      "body_end": 4839,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "h3",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00047",
      "text": "With tens of thousands participating in the event every year, the candlelight vigil at Victoria Park is the single biggest civic commemoration within Chinese territory.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 47,
      "body_start": 4841,
      "body_end": 5009,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00048",
      "text": "It is anticipated that this year's vigil will be much smaller as police officers have been given authority to disperse crowds thanks to the Prevention and Control of Disease (Prohibition on Group Gathering) Regulation that was enforced in response to COVID-19.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 48,
      "body_start": 5011,
      "body_end": 5271,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/202003/28/P2020032800720.htm"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00049",
      "text": "Last week, riot police arrested more than 900 people who protested against Beijing's decision to impose a new national security law on Hong Kong.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 49,
      "body_start": 5273,
      "body_end": 5418,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/2020/05/27/protests-police-crackdowns-return-to-hong-kong-as-beijing-tightens-grip/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00050",
      "text": "With that legislation looming, it is likely that future June 4 vigils will have to be organized in a more decentralized manner, with the main event potentially being staged outside Hong Kong.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 50,
      "body_start": 5420,
      "body_end": 5611,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00051",
      "text": "This year, it is possible that an even larger candlelight vigil will be held in Taiwan.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 51,
      "body_start": 5613,
      "body_end": 5700,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00052",
      "text": "Acknowledging this, the HK Alliance has issued a call for global solidarity and asked communities across the world to join the “memory battle” by using the social media hashtag #6431truth.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 52,
      "body_start": 5702,
      "body_end": 5890,
      "source_links": [
        "https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScf24r03UZ24Vn5l9IXpAxD7o5zatCdXQm07qnHLSTcKlJ9Ow/viewform"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00053",
      "text": "The Tiananmen democracy movement was a series of student-led demonstrations held in Tiananmen Square in Beijing in 1989. The 50 day-long peaceful protests began in April with the death of pro-reform Communist general secretary Hu Yaobang and ended with a military crackdown on June 4, 1989.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 53,
      "body_start": 5892,
      "body_end": 6182,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hu_Yaobang"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00054",
      "text": "According to a Chinese Red Cross estimate, 2,700 civilians were killed, while foreign diplomatic cables from the period suggested a figure up to four times higher.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 54,
      "body_start": 6184,
      "body_end": 6347,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/asia/tiananmen-square-massacre-death-toll-secret-cable-british-ambassador-1989-alan-donald-a8126461.html"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-708632-b00055",
      "text": "Discussions of Tiananmen are still taboo in mainland China and much of the younger generation knows little or nothing about the bloody crackdown.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 55,
      "body_start": 6349,
      "body_end": 6494,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    }
  ],
